{
  "project": {
    "name": "Neopixel / LED Matrix Frame",
    "slug": "matrix-frame",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "force_backend": true,
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "description": {
      "en": "Frames, diffusers, and mounts for WS2812 / NeoPixel addressable LED matrices, built to the real grid pitch — WS2812B panels use a ~10 mm pixel pitch (8x8 ≈ 80 mm, 16x16 ≈ 160 mm). Build a picture-frame bezel, an egg-crate diffuser with one cell per pixel, or a rear panel mount with corner bosses.\n\nOfficial visualizer and configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Marcos, difusores y montajes para matrices LED direccionables WS2812 / NeoPixel, construidos al paso real de la cuadrícula — los paneles WS2812B usan un paso de píxel de ~10 mm (8x8 ≈ 80 mm, 16x16 ≈ 160 mm). Genera un bisel tipo marco, un difusor tipo rejilla con una celda por píxel, o un montaje trasero con torres de esquina.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/matrix-frame.webp",
